    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Michael Pigott Auctioneer & Valuer is delighted to present for sale this beautiful four bedroom semi detached property situated in the hugely popular residential area in Carrigaline. \r\n\r\nThe property comes to the market in impeccable condition having been extremely well cared for and finished by its owner. The house is in turnkey condition and importantly ready for immediate occupation.  It offers spacious living and bedroom accommodation with well appointed rooms throughout. At ground floor, it has two good sized living rooms along with kitchen/dining, utility room and guest WC. Upstairs, it has four generous sized bedrooms (1 en-suite) & main bathroom.\r\n\r\nOutside is just as impressive with a beautifully landscaped rear garden that has an extensive brick paved patio area and offers excellent privacy. To the front, it has a spacious brick paved driveway and enjoys a nice quiet circle overlooking a well maintained green area.\r\n\r\nThe property is most conveniently located, within walking distance to all amenities and services in Carrigaline, most notably the highly regarded Carrigaline Educational Campus positioned at the entrance to the park and is only a short commute to Douglas, Cork City Centre, Cork Airport & Ringaskiddy. It also has easy access to a regular public bus service available \r\n\r\nViewing of this fabulous and pristine home comes highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Entrance Hallway - 3.97m x 2.28m \r\nWooden front door with side glazed panel, tile floor, alarm control panel, carpet stairway, centre light\r\n\r\nGuest WC - 1.66m x 0.75m \r\nTile floor, centre light decorative wallpaper and wall panelling, WHB with underneath storage press, WC. \r\n\r\nSitting Room - 4.25m x 3.63m \r\nWooden floor, centre light, large bay window, curtain pole, curtains, window blind, open fireplace with wooden surround. \r\n\r\nOpen Plan Kitchen/Dining/ Living Area – - \r\n\r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining - 6.67m x 2.98m \r\nTile floor, recessed lighting, extensive fitted kitchen unit with integrated oven, grill, electric hob, overhead extractor unit, dishwasher, fridge/freezer, tile splash-back, open plan to living area\r\n\r\nLiving Area - 2.86m x 3.75m \r\nWooden floor, centre light, fireplace with surround, fitted shelving, TV point, sliding door to patio area and rear garden, curtain pole, curtains.\r\n\r\nUtility Room - 1.18m x 1.93m \r\nTile floor, fitted cabinet, plumbed for washing machine, side door, centre light\r\n\r\nFIRST FLOOR - \r\n\r\n\r\nLanding Area - \r\nCarpet floor, hot press unit with shelving, centre light, stira stairs leading to overhead attic. \r\n\r\nBedroom 1 - 4.37m x 3.46m \r\nWooden floor, large built-in wardrobe unit, large bay window, curtain pole, curtains, window blinds. \r\n\r\nEn Suite - 2.52m x 0.87m \r\nFully tiled wall and floor, centre globe light, WC, WHB with underneath storage press, fitted cabinet with mirror, electric shower unit with chrome enclosure. \r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 3.23m x 2.89m \r\nWooden floor, centre light, large built-in wardrobe unit, curtain poles, curtain\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 - 3.0m x 3.76m \r\nWooden floor, built-in wardrobe unit, curtain pole, curtains\r\n\r\nBedroom 4 - 2.34m x 2.67m \r\nWooden floor, centre light, curtain pole, curtains.\r\n\r\nBathroom - 2.72m x 1.94m \r\nFully tiled wall and floor, WC, WHB, fitted wall mirror with light, window blind, bath unit, shower unit with chrome enclosure. \r\n\r\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Size: 119.5sq metres (1,285sq ft)\r\nGas Fired Central Heating\r\nPVC Double Glazed Windows & Doors\r\nB Energy Rating with condensing boiler\r\nSpacious living & Bedroom Accommodation\r\nBeautiful landscaped garden with good privacy\r\nOverlooking large green area to the front\r\nImpeccable condition throughout\r\nEasy access to a regular public bus service available closeby\r\nClose to all amenities & services in Carrigaline\r\nEasy commute to Cork City Centre & Cork Airport"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: B"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Directions",
        "SortOrder": 5,
        "Content": "From Cork, head towards Carrigaline and continue through the Shannonpark roundabout heading into Carrigaline.  Continue through the Herons Woods roundabout and at the next roundabout, turn right signposted for Douglas.  Continue straight out the Ballinrea Road and Dun Eoin is located  on the left handside.  Upon entering the estate, continue straight through taking the fourth left, (numbers are signposted on arrow signs). Turn right at the T-Junction and continue straight, keeping right at then around to your left. Dun Eoin Brook is on your left handside and No.4 is along here on the left hand side, indicated by our “For Sale” sign. Follow Eircode: P43 FK44"
      }
